{"resourceIdentifier":"4705","resourceName":"KIS BIOFUELS- UKINDO PROJECT","description":"This project description (PD) contains information about the KIS BIOFUELS- UKINDO Methane Avoidance from Industrial Wastewater in Indonesia.\r\nThe proposed project will implement biogas recovery, flaring and/or utilization systems for industrial wastewater treatment in Indonesia. The project involves installation of ZPHB® biogas tank & lagoon system plant for the treatment of wastewater from PT. UKINDO mill along with capturing the methane emissions from the plant and thereby reducing greenhouse gases (GHG) emissions into environment.\r\nThe project is located PT United Kingdom Indonesia Plantations (PT. UKINDO), a member of Anglo Eastern Plantations (AEP) Group, Blankahan POM, Desa Blankahan, Kec. Kuala, Kab. Langkat, Sumatera Utara Province, Indonesia.","location":{"latitude":3.494165,"longitude":98.397497},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-12-13","endExclusive":"2024-01-13","endInclusive":"2024-01-12"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4705"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Sumatera Utara"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"KNOWLEDGE INTEGRATION SERVICES SINGAPORE PTE. LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"KARNATAKA, India"},{"type":"string","value":"9740056484"},{"type":"string","value":"boothesha@knowledge-integration.org"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"54911"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.H."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4K Earth Science Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_RE